    "end": "He'll clear the wood. Later.",
    "caption": "Phil's to-do list is one job long.\n\nThicket: 2.7 million people, a 24-hour day, one moon, and a tree for every 'I'll do it later'. Most gardens have a couple. Students live in hedges. Phil has been going to fix the gate since the kids were little, and last week, when his wife asked again, he said the word.\n\n(On Earth, some bamboo grows almost a metre in a day. That's still slower than Phil's list.)\n\nWhich job has your house been putting off longest?"
  },
